      "evidence_type": "published tag insertion at this exact site",
      "functional_impact_measured": "PMC9623938: kAE1-Myc (Myc at 557) used as positive-control template in mutagenesis and functional trafficking studies; surface expression and function of WT-Myc construct implied as positive control. PMC12959882: construct used for cell-based expression studies in lentiviral system. Explicit anion-transport assay result NOT STATED in ledger.",
      "confidence": "high",
      "rationale": "Two independent papers (PMC9623938 and PMC12959882) explicitly name eAE1 position 557 as the insertion site for epitope tags (Myc and HA respectively) in full-length, membrane-anchored kAE1 constructs. PMC12959882 explicitly states 'position 557 (on eAE1)' confirming eAE1 canonical numbering. Python computation confirms: canonical[557]=V, canonical[558]=L; position 557 lies within EL3 (topology 542-569); 16 aa from TM4 C-terminus (541) and 13 aa from TM5 N-terminus (570), both >=3. No N-glycosylation motifs (NxS/T) or disulfide cysteines in EL3. The tag is inserted after V557 (insert_after_residue=557), placing it between V557 and L558 in the extracellular loop. [validation: surface_only; position: validated; source: paper; entailment_verified: True]",
      "sources": [
        {
          "pmid": 36320073,
          "citation": "PMID 36320073",
          "claim": "The kAE1-Myc protein has a Myc tag at position 557 in the third extracellular loop of the kAE1 protein, while the kAE1-HA protein has a HA tag at the C-terminus of the kAE1 protein. pcDNA3.1-kAE1 WT-Myc and pcDNA3.1-kAE1 WT-HA were used as templates for generation of pcDNA3.1-kAE1 T444N-Myc and pcDNA3.1-kAE1 T444N-HA by site-directed mutagenesis method using specific primers ( SLC4A1 -T444N forward: 5\u2032-GGAGCTGCTGATCTCCAATGCAGTGCAGGGCATTC-3\u2032; SLC4A1 -T444N reverse: 5\u2032-GAATGCCCTGCACTGCATTGGAGATCAGCAGCTCC-3\u2032) and Pfx DNA polymerase (Invitrogen, Carlsbad, CA, USA), as described previously [ 22 ]."
        }
      ],
      "plddt": null,
      "conservation_rank": null,
      "median_conservation": null
    },
    {
      "site_id": "SLC4A1-internal-558-lit",
